# Copy to `secrets.properties` (untracked) and fill in.
#
# The YouTube Data API v3 key is read at build time by core:network and injected as a BuildConfig
# field, so it never enters source control. A build without it still compiles and runs — every API
# call fails as ApiFailure.MissingKey and the app keeps serving cached data.
#
# Per ARCHITECTURE.md: use a key tied to a throwaway Google account. Registering a key means
# agreeing to YouTube's developer policies, which prohibit ad blocking in an API client, and the
# realistic consequence for an unpublished personal app is key revocation.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
